WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.799 line:8%
Select the student in Calls & follow-ups and choose Promised to pay.

00:00:05.813 --> 00:00:08.979 line:8%
Enter the agreed amount and promised date.

00:00:08.979 --> 00:00:12.596 line:8%
Select the relevant instalments and add useful notes.

00:00:14.723 --> 00:00:18.230 line:8%
Save and check the promise and follow-up task.

00:00:18.230 --> 00:00:23.491 line:8%
A promise is not collected money; actual payment evidence still needs review.
